      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我喜欢洗澡。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I liked taking baths.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02713",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "由于是夏天的关系，每逢中途暂停，我总是最先入浴。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Because it was summer, whenever there was a pause midway, I was always the first to bathe.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02713",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "这天大竹七段也兴冲冲的，几乎与我同时来到了澡堂。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That day, Otake seventh dan also came eagerly to the bathhouse, almost at the same time as I did.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
